  "body": "Enjoy the best of Mission Bay from this renovated two-bedroom apartment in the Bay Terraces complex. Overlooking Mission Bay Reserve, it places the waterfront promenade, beach, cafes, restaurants and shops just a short stroll from your door.\r\n\r\nThe sun-filled, open-plan living area flows to a private balcony with views across the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto Island. Both spacious bedrooms have their own ensuites, while a separate laundry with an additional toilet, ample storage and a security system add everyday convenience. Two car parks, including one covered space, complete the picture.\r\n\r\nWith the ease of apartment living and the beach on your doorstep, this is an appealing option for those seeking a permanent seaside home, an alternative to retirement village living, an investment or a lock-and-leave retreat.",
